    rdfs:comment "0.134.0 (2026-10-21): Build tasks and Verify tasks of the Stage 3.F / Stage 4 gap stories recorded Done on bridge-verified evidence: ['TK_Gap3F_Ch01_Build', 'TK_GapS4_Ch01_Build', 'TK_Gap3F_Ch01_Verify', 'TK_GapS4_Ch01_Verify', 'TK_GapS4_Ch02_Build', 'TK_GapS4_Ch02_Verify', 'TK_GapS4_Ch03_Build', 'TK_GapS4_Ch03_Verify', 'TK_GapS4_Ch04_Build', 'TK_GapS4_Ch04_Verify', 'TK_GapS4_Ch05_Build', 'TK_GapS4_Ch06_Build', 'TK_GapS4_Ch06_Verify', 'TK_GapS4_Ch07_Build', 'TK_GapS4_Ch07_Verify', 'TK_Gap3F_Numbers_Build', 'TK_GapS4_Numbers_Build', 'TK_Gap3F_Numbers_Verify', 'TK_GapS4_Numbers_Verify']; not recorded: ['TK_GapS4_Ch05_Verify']."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.133.0 (2026-10-20): closedAtCommit of the rebuilt Backlog output ex:Out3_BacklogR3 filled; work begun on TK_Gap3F_Ch05_Build at 2026-10-20T23:49:46 UTC (start gate READY); the lineage is InProgress."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.132.0 (2026-10-20): third lineage, Backlog stage rebuilt for chapter 5: criterion AC3G_3F_Ch05, tasks TK_Gap3F_Ch05_Build and TK_Gap3F_Ch05_Verify, scope change SC3_Gaps5, change request Accepted; objective target 2 -> 3; 44 items re-admitted, not re-dated."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.131.0 (2026-10-20): StageRevision of the third lineage from the Backlog stage (G125 route 2): the Backlog output ex:Out3_BacklogR2 is retracted for the Stage 3.F gap of chapter 5; nothing is rebuilt here."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.130.0 (2026-10-20): ChangeRequest ex:CR3_Gaps5 (Pending) and ImpactAssessment ex:IA3_Gaps5: chapter 5 fails Stage 3.F under the current validator (found by measurement); the owner's direction of 2026-10-20 10:42 Istanbul covers it; no stage changed."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.129.0 (2026-10-20): Work begun on the READY Build tasks of ST_Gap_Stage3F and ST_Gap_Stage4 (start gate READY for the lineage and for each task); started 2026-10-20T16:17:19 UTC; the stories and the lineage are InProgress."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.128.0 (2026-10-20): closedAtCommit of the rebuilt Backlog output of the third lineage set to the commit that closed it."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.127.0 (2026-10-20): third lineage, Backlog stage rebuilt by the stage revision: two stories (Stage 3.F of two Stage 3 documents; the Stage 4 page ABox of eight units, one acceptance criterion per unit) with 20 execution tasks, refinement and planning events into the eleventh iteration, test cases, the class models and the ScopeChange that admits them; the change request is Accepted; the 22 carried items are re-admitted by the rebuilt output, not re-dated."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.126.0 (2026-10-20): third lineage, Objective stage rebuilt by the stage revision: three objectives (Stage 3.F passes, Stage 4 page ABoxes pass, gates unchanged) with metric, checkpoint and a baseline reading measured on 2026-10-20; the activity and sequence models."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.125.0 (2026-10-20): third lineage, Goal stage rebuilt by the stage revision: goals for the Stage 3.F repair, the Stage 4 page ABox and the unchanged gates; two specifications with a nominal and a rejection scenario each; the use case model."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.124.0 (2026-10-20): third lineage, Scope stage rebuilt by the stage revision: two deliverables (the Stage 3.F repair and the Stage 4 page ABox), their area, an exclusion (no gate, test or threshold changed; no connectedness repair) and two domain entities with their gaps."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.123.0 (2026-10-20): StageRevision of the third lineage from the Scope stage (ruling G127): the Scope, Goal, Objective and Backlog outputs are retracted; nothing is rebuilt in this version. The change request and impact assessment are in the previous version; the owner's direction of 2026-10-20 10:42 Istanbul is quoted in both."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.122.0 (2026-10-20): ChangeRequest ex:CR3_Gaps (disposition Pending) and ImpactAssessment ex:IA3_Gaps for the owner's direction of 2026-10-20 10:42 Istanbul, \"No, fill the gaps first.\": the Stage 3.F and Stage 4 gaps are to be closed before the Mission outcome is recorded; no stage is changed in this version."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.121.0 (2026-10-20): Corrected caveat on the ClosureReport: the measured Stage 3.F and Stage 4 state of chapters 1 to 7 and the numbers page, and which of them are tasks of this lineage. Notes only."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.120.0 (2026-10-20): The ClosureReport of the Mission added (summary, 18 objectives, 18 retrospective findings, 8 caveats, 6 practices). The Mission outcome and the status of the third lineage are NOT changed: they wait for the owner's act."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.119.0 (2026-10-20): The initiative Init_Slides recorded Done on the owner's direction of 2026-10-20 09:19 Istanbul: its three epics are Done, and the completion check run by the evidence bridge passed."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.118.0 (2026-10-20): Status and dates repaired on the owner's direction of 2026-10-20 09:19 Istanbul: the 3 epics recorded Done with the dates of their children and bridge-verified evidence; 13 page link-pass tasks moved under ST_Page_LinkPass (G125); 21 story finishes moved to the finish of their last task; 34 single-instant tasks stated as estimated starts (G120); Iter_11 start set to its earliest task; Obj3_FailuresNamed corrected forward to 5; Lineage3 status InProgress; the initiative follows in the next version."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.117.0 (2026-10-19): Stage 4 tasks of chapters [8, 9, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14] recorded Done on the bridge-verified gate run, chapter checks and file hashes; not recorded: none."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.116.0 (2026-10-19): Two audit notes of v0.115 corrected forward: chapter 3's F15 cites only P85 and chapter 4's F15 cites P17 and not P85 (an error of the course session)."@en ;
