    rdfs:comment "0.103.0 (2026-10-18): The owner's answers of 2026-10-19 recorded as his dated act (succession and Mission confirmed, iteration dates confirmed, BOLT licence CC BY 4.0, same standards for the pages of chapters 6 and 13, status of the chapters 1-4 decks and the chapter 13 page); the intent-origin correction of the second and third lineage elements. Notes only."@en ;
