    rdfs:comment "0.101.0 (2026-10-18): third lineage, Backlog stage closed: the 20 open tasks of the second lineage are admitted open with an executor; the deck link pass and the page link pass are admitted as finished stories with their git dates, criterion, harness, audit date, modality and bridge-verified evidence (decks of chapters 1-4 and the page of chapter 13 admitted failing, with file hashes only). The first-lineage items the first succession carried (the pages of chapters 6 and 13, three epics, the initiative) stay admitted by the second lineage's Backlog output: moving them would move its digest."@en ;
