    backlog:hasTestSpec "RDODI procedure v1.6.0, Stages 1-3 for Mastering Bitcoin's chapter 1, built by 08-tooling/sen0401_rdodi_build_v1_0_0.py from sen0401_ch01_rdodi_data_v1_0_0.py. All gates PASS after two fixes: RDODI's citation detector could not read W3C as an author (a digit in the name), so W3C is cited as World Wide Web Consortium; and one of the chapter's sections was not named in the document. Stage1.A-B, Stage2.A, C and H, Stage3.A, B, F, E.cov, E.sub and src with RDODI's validator functions; Stage1.C-E, Stage2.B (HermiT consistent), D-G, Stage3.C-E (coverage 25/25), G and H as direct checks." ; backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Gates run over the artefacts as published in sen0401-v0.7.0 (a69f51d)." ;
