    backlog:hasTestSpec "RDODI procedure v1.6.0, Stages 1-3 for Mastering Bitcoin's chapter 3 by 08-tooling/sen0401_rdodi_build_v1_1_0.py from sen0401_ch03_rdodi_data_v1_0_0.py: gates Stage1.A to Stage3.src all PASS with RDODI's own validator (17 citations, 49 sections), and 41 executed checks with 0 mismatches under Python 3.14.4 - every input-output example, the transaction's txid and wtxid from its hex, Merkle root and header hash of block 123456, the block 775072 totals, and the facts read from the real Bitcoin Core 31.1 release (downloaded, SHA-256 equal to its SHA256SUMS, 11 good signatures, run as an offline node; outputs in 08-tooling/ch03-evidence); HermiT consistent; a wrong expected value was refused by the checker. One printed result in the book was found not to match its script and is recorded as a finding." ; backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Gates run over the artefacts as published in the release carrying the chapter 3 research record." ;
