ex:ST_Page_Ch11 backlog:hasAuditNote "Agent-reported disclosures for the chapter 11 page (from the course coordinator's relay of the builder's report, not re-verified here). The chapter check ran the newest page test, 9.35.0; the builder reports 9.34.0 and 9.35.0 give the same result: 368 passed, 2 skipped, 0 failed, the skips being the filled-ERD checks. Template 9.47.0: a tooltip is cut at about 300 characters. 44 of 69 examples run in the browser and 25 are Recorded. Left out of the page: mempool.space, the Haber-Stornetta and Merkle papers, and BIP 34. The test key was used, which proves page logic only." .
ex:Harness2_Page_Ch11 a backlog:TestHarness ; rdfs:label "Chapter check for Page Ch11"@en ; backlog:harnessFor ex:ST_Page_Ch11 ; backlog:hasHarnessEvidence ex:Ev2_Page_Ch11 .
ex:Ev2_Page_Ch11 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Chapter check for Page Ch11"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage2 ; backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter, ex:AC2_Admission ;
