ex:ST_Page_Ch09 backlog:hasEvidence ex:Ev3C2_Page_Ch09, ex:Ev3C2_Page_Ch09_File1 ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Forward-dated note, 2026-10-15 (agent-reported; the Done record is untouched): the chapter 9 page was rebuilt as version 9.46.0 (commit c3f1277), which supersedes version 9.43.0 (commit 2b43edc); the page now rests on the corrected research 1_0_1. The chapter check (newest page test, test key, proves page logic only) was run again by the evidence bridge on the rebuilt page and exited 0, so Done stands. The earlier evidence cites the 9.43.0 page by SHA-256; that file is unchanged in git history and still verifies. OPEN OWNER QUESTION, agent-reported: the rebuilt page's wheel still embeds mainnet_fee_census_v1_0_0.json from mempool.space, which has no stated licence." .
ex:ST_Page_Ch10 backlog:hasAuditNote "Forward-dated note, 2026-10-15 (agent-reported; no evidence is added because the cited page file did not change): the chapter 10 page was built from research version 1_0_0, and research chapter 10 was corrected as 1_0_1 (commit 992d2f0) after the page was recorded Done. The page has not been rebuilt on 1_0_1. The Done record rests on the page's own check, which still passes; whether the page must be rebuilt is a decision for the course, and the story is not reopened here." .

