ex:ST_Page_Ch12 backlog:hasAuditNote "Agent-reported disclosures for the chapter 12 page (from the course coordinator's relay of the builder's report, not re-verified here). The chapter check ran the newest page test, 9.35.0; the builder reports that 9.34.0 and 9.35.0 both give 370 passed, 0 skipped, 0 failed, with 86 of 86 widgets. 42 of 65 examples run in the browser and 23 are Recorded. Left out of the page: the mempool.space data (18 examples), BIP 34 (no licence line, 2 examples), the Eyal-Sirer paper, the Stratum V2 specification and other papers. A book code listing is carried under CC BY-SA 4.0 with no separate code licence found: an OPEN LICENCE QUESTION. The builder changed its own test configuration question for 9.34.0, not the test. The test key was used, which proves page logic only." .
