ex:ST_Page_Ch10 backlog:hasEvidence ex:Ev3C3_Page_Ch10, ex:Ev3C3_Page_Ch10_File1 ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Forward-dated note, 2026-10-16 (agent-reported; the Done record is untouched): this note closes the earlier note that the chapter 10 page had not been rebuilt on research 1_0_1. The page was rebuilt as version 9.48.0 (commit 8158779, supersedes 9.44.0 / 62d7b97) from research version 1_0_1. The builder reports page tests 9.34.0 and 9.35.0 both at 368 passed, 0 failed; the stored output of OrphanageLimits now shows its real output; 49 of 62 examples run in the browser and 13 are Recorded; the wheel is unchanged and reused. The chapter check (newest page test, test key, proves page logic only) was run again by the evidence bridge on the rebuilt page and exited 0, so Done stands. The earlier evidence cites the 9.44.0 page by SHA-256; that file is unchanged in git history and still verifies. The new evidence cites the 9.48.0 page." .
