    backlog:hasAuditNote "Dated note, 2026-10-16 (agent-reported by the course coordinator, not re-verified here; the Done record is untouched): this note closes the licence-question note of register version 0.84.0. The chapter 12 page was rebuilt as version 9.49.0 (commit ad54ce9, supersedes 9.47.0 / 97bd35a) with wheel 1.0.1 and no book code listing; BookScriptFloatErratum is now Recorded. The builder reports 41 of 65 examples run in the browser and 24 Recorded, and page tests 9.34.0 and 9.35.0 both at 370 passed, 0 skipped, 0 failed with 86 of 86 widgets. The chapter check (newest page test, test key, proves page logic only) was run again by the evidence bridge on the rebuilt page and exited 0, so Done stands. The earlier evidence cites the 9.47.0 page by SHA-256; that file is unchanged in git history and still verifies. The new evidence cites the 9.49.0 page." .

