ex:ST_Page_Ch14 backlog:hasAuditNote "Agent-reported disclosures for the chapter 14 page (from the course coordinator's relay of the builder's report, not re-verified here). The chapter check ran the newest page test, 9.35.0; the builder reports 9.34.0 and 9.35.0 both at 370 passed, 0 skipped, 0 failed, 68 of 68 widgets. 40 of 50 examples run in the browser and 10 are Recorded. Left out of the page: the mempool.space Lightning statistics (3 examples), bolt04_onion_test.json (no stated licence, 3), the Poon-Dryja paper, the Rosenfeld colored-coins paper, the cln README and the RGB page (1 each). The test key was used, which proves page logic only." .
