ex:TK_Deck_Ch01_CheckFix backlog:hasAuditNote "Correction recorded 2026-10-18 (ruling G125): a link pass over finished decks or pages is a story of its own, and a task cannot carry it. This task, recorded in the versions 0.91 to 0.93, is therefore not the carrier of that work from now on; the Deck link pass and the Page link pass are admitted as stories by the successor lineage, which cites the same files by hash. The older records are not edited (L-112). This follow-up item is out-scoped in the next version and carried by the successor lineage." .
