ex:Revision_Lineage3_Objective rdfs:comment "Owner-directed and owner-confirmed. Owner's direction, 2026-10-19 00:51 Istanbul (2026-10-18T21:51:00 UTC), relayed by the course coordinator: \"If there is a requirement in the lineage you should never bypass it. This is a drift and breaking the rules. You should never do such a thing. And you should do this in time not after the completion of the work.\" This direction started the stage revision. Owner's confirmation, 2026-10-19 01:50 Istanbul (2026-10-18T22:50:00 UTC), relayed by the course coordinator: \"OK, confirmed. But do you need this? The current adaptations are initiated by my directions.\" He confirmed the stage revision from the Objective stage that paid the class-model debt, and said it follows from his direction. From now on, work that follows from an owner's direction is recorded as owner-directed with the quoted direction and its time, and is not listed as an open owner confirmation."@en .
ex:Out3_ObjectiveR rdfs:comment "Rebuilt by the owner-directed stage revision. Owner's direction, 2026-10-19 00:51 Istanbul (2026-10-18T21:51:00 UTC), relayed by the course coordinator: \"If there is a requirement in the lineage you should never bypass it. This is a drift and breaking the rules. You should never do such a thing. And you should do this in time not after the completion of the work.\" This direction started the stage revision."@en .
ex:Out3_BacklogR rdfs:comment "Rebuilt by the owner-directed stage revision, without a waiver. Owner's direction, 2026-10-19 00:51 Istanbul (2026-10-18T21:51:00 UTC), relayed by the course coordinator: \"If there is a requirement in the lineage you should never bypass it. This is a drift and breaking the rules. You should never do such a thing. And you should do this in time not after the completion of the work.\" This direction started the stage revision. Owner's confirmation, 2026-10-19 01:50 Istanbul (2026-10-18T22:50:00 UTC), relayed by the course coordinator: \"OK, confirmed. But do you need this? The current adaptations are initiated by my directions.\" He confirmed the stage revision from the Objective stage that paid the class-model debt, and said it follows from his direction."@en .
