ex:TK_Licence_Mempool_Ch09 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:startedAt "2026-10-18T22:50:00"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:startedAtIsEstimate true ; backlog:startEstimateBasis "Not witnessed: the work and its files first appear in one commit (065b1a7, 2026-10-19T02:22:10 UTC). Estimated as the latest owner message of the day before the work, the confirmation of 2026-10-19 01:50 Istanbul (2026-10-18T22:50:00 UTC); the owner's question that started the work is dated 2026-10-19 and its time was not relayed." ; backlog:finishedAt "2026-10-19T02:22:10"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:lastAuditedAt "2026-10-19T03:42:56"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:hasExecutionModality backlog:Mode_Hybrid ; backlog:hasAcceptanceCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:hasEvidence ex:Ev3PG_Licence_Mempool_Ch09, ex:Ev3PG_Page_Ch09, ex:Ev3PG_Prov_Ch09, ex:Ev3PG_Census_Ch09 ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Done, recorded 2026-10-19: the mempool.space census is no longer carried; the page embeds the course's own census (mainnet_fee_census_v2_0_0.json, CC BY 4.0: facts of the block chain collected from mempool.space and blockstream.info and cross-checked, statistics computed by the course's collector). The evidence bridge ran the physical licence check (it opens the page's embedded wheel and lists its files) and verified the SHA-256 of the page sen0401_ch09_page_v9_68_0.html (commit 065b1a7) and of the provenance file. Owner-directed: \"Can we collect our own statistics from the network or alternative resources?\" (2026-10-19; the time was not relayed)." .
