    backlog:hasAuditNote "Correction recorded 2026-10-19 (G125 option 1, new evidence on the same Done story): the page had stale links against the story's own criterion; it was rebuilt as sen0401_ch01_page_v9_70_0.html (commit 886a611) on template 9.51.0 from the corrected deck's lecture export, so story cards, READ links and resource lists equal the deck's. The evidence bridge ran the chapter check Page/Ch01 (newest page test, a TEST release key: it proves the page's logic, not the real instructor key) and the deck match check, and verified the SHA-256 of the page. The earlier evidence of the replaced page stays as the dated record. Disclosed: the older tool pages_link_verify still compares with the OLD deck link registers (link_register_v1_0_0.json, 2026-10-16, untouched) and reports their superseded entries as not carried (8 for this chapter). Owner-directed: \"Keep the same standards with all other pages.\" (2026-10-19)." .
