    backlog:hasAuditNote "Done, recorded 2026-10-19: Stage 3.F passes for chapter 2 after the citation repair (Stage 3 document patch version, commit b4c7a07), the verify script of the chapter was written (commit ff82603), and the evidence bridge ran the lineage chapter check v1_3_0 for Research/Ch02 (Stage 1-3 gates, corpus claims, verify script, HermiT; exit 0) and, run again, for Deck/Ch02 and Page/Ch02 (the page test uses a TEST release key and proves the page logic only). It verified the SHA-256 of the newest research file, the newest Stage 3 document, the verify script and the shared verify library (commits ed50d68, ff82603). Chapter 2: research v1.4.0 and document v1.3.2 restore the source P03 and carry the label (Bitcoin Core, 2026) on the six Bitcoin Core publications P30-P35 (commit ed50d68). Disclosed: the research scorecard text still carries the old source counts. The checks Stage4.cov and Stage4.sub on the pages of chapters 2-4 are PROPOSED checks that were failing before; this register records no result for them, they are not part of this task, and nothing here claims they pass." .
