ex:TK_Research_Ch03_Stage3F backlog:hasAuditNote "Correction recorded 2026-10-19, an error of the course session (not of the framework or the research agent's files): the audit note written in register v0.115 for this task named the wrong sources for finding F15. It said that chapter 3's F15 cites the JSON-RPC 2.0 specification (P85) and BIP 142 (P17). Read from the research file v1.3.0 of chapter 3, F15 cites only the JSON-RPC 2.0 specification (P85), beside the sources it already had (P01, P25); it does not cite BIP 142. BIP 142 (P17) is chapter 4's F15 source. The briefing the session was given said both, and the session wrote it without checking the file. Nothing else in the note changes; the older note stays as the dated record (L-112)." .
ex:TK_Research_Ch04_Stage3F backlog:hasAuditNote "Correction recorded 2026-10-19, an error of the course session (not of the framework or the research agent's files): the audit note written in register v0.115 for this task named the wrong sources for finding F15. It said that chapter 4's F15 cites P85 and BIP 142 (P17). Read from the research file v1.3.0 of chapter 4, F15 cites BIP 142 (P17), with its existing sources; chapter 4 has no P85 (the JSON-RPC 2.0 specification) at all - that source is chapter 3's. The P17 label correction from Wuille 2015 to Lau 2015, and the statement about F15's Closed status and BIP 173 replacing 142 being read from saved copies, stand as written. The session wrote the note from the briefing without checking the file. The older note stays as the dated record (L-112)." .

