    backlog:hasAuditNote "Done, recorded 2026-10-19: the Stage 4 page ABox of chapter 8 is built (builder v2_0_0, commits 2161e8b, be07826, f34b88f). The evidence bridge ran RDODI's pipeline validator over the chapter's Stage 1 to 4 artefacts through the Stage 4 gate runner (exit 0: no gate FAILs) and the lineage chapter checks v1_3_0 for Research, Deck and Page, and verified the SHA-256 of the page ABox, the builder, the gate runner and the committed gate output. Disclosed: Stage4.L, Cross.C, Stage1.C and Stage1.E report NOT_MEASURED (the research files carry no concept inventory), and Cross.B reports CANNOT_RUN (the Stage 3 documents record a section's concept in dcterms:source, not prov:wasDerivedFrom, so no page region can chain through them): none of these is a pass and none is claimed. Stage4.cov and Stage4.sub are PROPOSED checks. The page test used the TEST release key only: it proves the page's logic, not the real instructor key. Chapter 8: the Stage 3.F citation repair is research v1.1.0 (commit 2161e8b, labels only: every cited source was already held, the labels lacked the author-year string); the Fiat-Shamir label gives 1986 (the CRYPTO conference) and 1987 (the Springer volume date). The chapter check runs the newest page test, 9.35.0, on the page 9.51.0; the older test 9.34.0 on this page keeps its known result (113 pass, 1 fail, then a crash), which the chapter check does not show: it is unchanged and is NOT claimed to pass." .
