ex:ST_Page_Ch01 backlog:hasAuditNote "Date repair 2026-10-20 (owner direction of that day): the link-pass task of this chapter, hung under this story in the versions 0.91 to 0.93, finished on 2026-10-16, long after this story was Done; under ruling G125 the link pass is a story of its own (ST_Page_LinkPass) and a task hung under a finished story makes its finish date contradict the parent. The task is now a child of ST_Page_LinkPass; its dates, evidence and notes are unchanged and the committed versions stay as the record (L-112)." .
