    backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work .
ex:Del3_Stage3FRepair a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ;
    rdfs:label "The Stage 3 documents of chapter 1 and Bitcoin in numbers pass Stage 3.F"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "the research behind it and an interactive page"^^xsd:string ;
    backlog:hasDeliverableText "The Stage 3 documents of chapter 1 and of Bitcoin in numbers pass the Stage 3.F gate unchanged: every external claim is cited and every citation resolves to a source of the research file. Stage 3.F of the Stage 3 documents, measured on 2026-10-20 with the lineage chapter check v1_3_0 (Research/ChNN) and the Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0: chapter 1 FAIL (1 external claim uncited); Bitcoin in numbers FAIL (19 dangling citations); chapters 2 to 14 PASS (every claim cited, every citation verified; chapters 5, 6 and 7 with 36, 34 and 55 citations, and the whole chapter check PASS for each). The build notes of 2026-10-14 that name chapter 7 as failing, and the stage-4 status note that names chapter 8 (45 dangling citations), are out of date: both chapters pass today." ;
    backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area3_GapClosure ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:hasProductScopeKind backlog:Kind_Functional .
ex:Del3_Stage4PageAbox a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ;
    rdfs:label "A Stage 4 page ABox for chapters 1 to 7 and Bitcoin in numbers that passes the Stage 4 gate run"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "the research behind it and an interactive page"^^xsd:string ;
    backlog:hasDeliverableText "A Stage 4 page ABox, built by the Stage 4 builder from the newest page, its objectives, its quiz and its stored browser-test result, for chapters 1 to 7 and for Bitcoin in numbers, that passes the Stage 4 gate run unchanged; the older ABoxes of chapters 1 to 4 and of Bitcoin in numbers stay as the record. Stage 4 page ABox, measured on 2026-10-20 with the Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0: chapters 1, 2, 3, 4 and Bitcoin in numbers have an older ABox that FAILS Stage4.cov (10 typed individuals lack label and content, in each) and Stage4.sub (116, 84, 108, 94 and 58 individuals not substantive); chapters 5, 6 and 7 have no Stage 4 page ABox, so the runner stops with an IndexError; chapters 8 to 14 have one that passes." ;
    backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area3_GapClosure ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:hasProductScopeKind backlog:Kind_Functional .
ex:Excl3_NoGateChange a backlog:ScopeExclusion ;
    rdfs:label "The gaps are closed without changing a gate, a test or a threshold, and without the connectedness repair"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:excludesConcern "Any change to a gate, a test or a threshold in order to make a unit pass (Stage 3.F, the Stage 4 gates, the chapter checks, the page tests); a citation or a claim removed only to make a gate pass; the connectedness repair of the T-Box files, which the owner deferred on 2026-10-20 09:19 Istanbul to a later lineage; recording the Mission outcome and the Achieved status of this lineage, which wait for the owner's act after the gaps are closed." ;
    backlog:hasExclusionRationale "A gate that is changed to pass proves nothing; a unit that fails stays reported as failing until it passes unchanged gates. The owner deferred quality and cleaning work until after this lineage and decided on 2026-10-20 10:42 Istanbul that the gaps are closed before the Mission outcome is recorded, not that the outcome is recorded first." ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work .
ex:Scope3 backlog:requiresDeliverable ex:Del3_Stage3FRepair, ex:Del3_Stage4PageAbox ;
    backlog:coversArea ex:Area3_GapClosure ; backlog:hasScopeExclusion ex:Excl3_NoGateChange ;
    rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_Gaps, ex:IA3_Gaps .
ex:Scope3 rdfs:comment "Revised 2026-10-20 by the stage revision ex:Revision_Lineage3_Scope on the owner's direction of 2026-10-20 10:42 Istanbul (2026-10-20T07:42:00 UTC), quoted: \"No, fill the gaps first.\". The statement above is unchanged (L-112). It now also requires the deliverables ex:Del3_Stage3FRepair and ex:Del3_Stage4PageAbox, covers the area ex:Area3_GapClosure and carries the exclusion ex:Excl3_NoGateChange. IN, added: the Stage 3.F repair of the Stage 3 documents of chapter 1 and Bitcoin in numbers, and a Stage 4 page ABox that passes the gate run for chapters 1 to 7 and Bitcoin in numbers. OUT, added: any change to a gate, a test or a threshold, and the connectedness repair. The exclusion ex:Excl3_NoRebuild stands: nothing is rebuilt to admit it, and these deliverables are new files beside the old ones."@en .
