    backlog:hasAuditNote "Created by the stage revision ex:Revision_Lineage3_Scope on the owner's direction of 2026-10-20 10:42 Istanbul (2026-10-20T07:42:00 UTC), quoted: \"No, fill the gaps first.\". One criterion per document (G133). Chapters 5, 6 and 7 were measured and pass Stage 3.F; they need no work. Stage 3.F of the Stage 3 documents, measured on 2026-10-20 with the lineage chapter check v1_3_0 (Research/ChNN) and the Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0: chapter 1 FAIL (1 external claim uncited); Bitcoin in numbers FAIL (19 dangling citations); chapters 2 to 14 PASS (every claim cited, every citation verified; chapters 5, 6 and 7 with 36, 34 and 55 citations, and the whole chapter check PASS for each). The build notes of 2026-10-14 that name chapter 7 as failing, and the stage-4 status note that names chapter 8 (45 dangling citations), are out of date: both chapters pass today." .

