    backlog:hasAuditNote "Created by the stage revision ex:Revision_Lineage3_Scope on the owner's direction of 2026-10-20 10:42 Istanbul (2026-10-20T07:42:00 UTC), quoted: \"No, fill the gaps first.\". One criterion per unit (G133). Stage 4 page ABox, measured on 2026-10-20 with the Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0: chapters 1, 2, 3, 4 and Bitcoin in numbers have an older ABox that FAILS Stage4.cov (10 typed individuals lack label and content, in each) and Stage4.sub (116, 84, 108, 94 and 58 individuals not substantive); chapters 5, 6 and 7 have no Stage 4 page ABox, so the runner stops with an IndexError; chapters 8 to 14 have one that passes. The Stage 4 gate run of chapter 1 and of Bitcoin in numbers includes Stage 3.F, so the verify tasks of those two units depend on the Stage 3.F build tasks." .

